__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
receipts/*
!receipts/README.md
# MEASURED TRAP, repaired. `receipts/*` ignores every evidence receipt, so
# `git add -A` would carry ZERO of them while a report could still claim
# "receipts committed". Phase 8/9 receipts are named explicitly. Scratch
# files (`_*.txt`) stay ignored on purpose: they are console dumps, not
# evidence, and are deleted rather than committed.
!receipts/phase*.json
!receipts/kernel_*.json
data/
# Staged benchmark corpora are NEVER committed. MMLU 6.4 MiB, GPQA 1.3 MiB,
# MBPP 0.55 MiB. Every receipt records the sha256 of the file it read, so a
# fresh clone can re-stage and verify it reached the same bytes. Digests are
# recorded in docs/EVIDENCE_REGISTER.md section 12.
